    {"id": 8, "kind": "heading", "owner": "n46", "literal": "46. 多项式的导数"},
    {"id": 9, "kind": "theorem", "owner": "n46", "literal": "定理. 以自然数 n>1 为指数的幂函数"},
    {"id": 10, "kind": "theorem-formula", "owner": "n46", "literal": "x→x^n，"},
    {"id": 11, "kind": "theorem", "owner": "n46", "literal": "它的导数等于指数 n 和幂函数 x^(n-1) 的积，即"},
    {"id": 12, "kind": "theorem-formula", "owner": "n46", "literal": "(x^n)'=nx^(n-1)。 (1)", "shared": "formula number"},
    {"id": 13, "kind": "proof", "owner": "n46", "literal": "证明 用数学归纳法证明。当 n=2 时，公式(1)成立(参"},
    {"id": 14, "kind": "proof", "owner": "n46", "literal": "看第 43 小节例 3)。下一步证明：如果对于 n=k 公式(1)成"},
    {"id": 15, "kind": "proof", "owner": "n46", "literal": "立，那么对于 n=k+1 它也成立。事实上，根据积的微分法"},
    {"id": 16, "kind": "proof", "owner": "n46", "literal": "则，有"},
    {"id": 17, "kind": "proof-formula", "owner": "n46", "literal": "(x^(k+1))'=(x^k·x)'=(x^k)'·x+x^k·(x)'"},
    {"id": 18, "kind": "proof-formula", "owner": "n46", "literal": "=kx^(k-1)·x+x^k·1=(k+1)x^k。"},
    {"id": 19, "kind": "proof-conclusion", "owner": "n46", "literal": "由此，根据数学归纳法得出，公式(1)对一切自然数 n>1 都"},
    {"id": 20, "kind": "proof-conclusion", "owner": "n46", "literal": "成立。"},
    {"id": 21, "kind": "open-paragraph", "owner": "n46", "literal": "由这个定理和前面得到的微分法则得出，多项式是处处", "right_boundary": "after 处处; no completion on source166"},
